    "comment_grip": "抓取锁定：lock_radius_m（锁粒半径）/ max_lock_approach_m（最大接近距离，防隔空抓取）/ finger_close_ratio（指闭合阈值）。经 xpbd_process → DG_LOCK_RADIUS_M / DG_MAX_LOCK_APPROACH_M / DG_FINGER_CLOSE_RATIO。"
  },
